ng to Sky's career pages.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/017966e6be4e6579f1e35ac3eb47e2e1?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-02-13T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"AJaAqazE2","title":"Pytest Appium: iOS/Android Setup BrowserStack and Simulators","url":"https://showmax.engineering/articles/pytest-appium-iosandroid-setup-browserstack-and-simulators","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/pytest-appium-ios-android-setup-browserstack-and-simulators-ajaaqaze2","summary":"Learn how to use Pytest Appium to write and run automated tests for mobile applications on iOS and Android. Discover how to use simulators and BrowserStack for testing on various platforms.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c6c3dd29665f6dd04b04f54eccfa7348?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-12-14T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"a9eBNj8Z0","title":"Inspirations from Droidcon Lisbon","url":"https://showmax.engineering/articles/inspirations-from-droidcon-lisbon","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/inspirations-from-droidcon-lisbon-a9ebnj8z0","summary":"Recently, the author visited Sky Portugal offices and attended the DroidCon Lisbon conference. Some of the session highlights included practical ADB usage, signing in with Android, ML Kit on Android, Custom Composables, moving to Material3, K2 in production, and transitioning from a monolith to a multi-module app.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/e5071a1ec86d66b4c63ac35372cdeeb0?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-12-05T09:38:13.975Z"},{"id":"K2juNnn0v","title":"Integration Tests","url":"https://showmax.engineering/articles/integration-tests","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/integration-tests-k2junnn0v","summary":"The article discusses the importance of integration tests in software development and how they can help identify potential issues and ensure seamless integration. It also explains the use of fixtures in integration tests and how a monorepo can aid in automation.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/ed658c72f19bddbd1b3abd6bc37d504c?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-11-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"ZadNVL37v","title":"Designing Swag and Culture: Unveiling the Remarkable Spirit of Showmax Engineering","url":"https://showmax.engineering/articles/designing-swag-and-culture-unveiling-the-remarkable","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/designing-swag-and-culture-unveiling-the-remarkable-spirit-of-showmax-engineering-zadnvl37v","summary":"This article explores the process of designing the Swag and Culture for Showmax Engineering, including the creation of a brand guide and various swag items. It highlights the importance of aligning the brand with the values and spirit of the team.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/56f8e7daca67d29ae5bb7a10fe13cd78?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"r1R7f8UyW","title":"Exploring Kotlin Multiplatform Mobile: A Comprehensive Overview","url":"https://showmax.engineering/articles/exploring-kotlin-multiplatform-mobile-a-comprehensive","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/exploring-kotlin-multiplatform-mobile-a-comprehensive-overview-r1r7f8uyw","summary":"JetBrains' new framework known as Kotlin Multiplatform Mobile (KMP) extends beyond Android to encompass platforms like iOS, web, and desktop. The primary objective of KMP is to facilitate code sharing across various platforms, effectively curbing development costs. The goal is to write to a shared module and especially to commonMain.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/6b3990c9b4ead558d41b2a183f1adc40?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-09-14T07:28:32.176Z"},{"id":"l2SA7RQtL","title":"Clustering Users for Better Content Recommendations","url":"https://showmax.engineering/articles/clustering-users-for-better-content-recommendations","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/clustering-users-for-better-content-recommendations-l2sa7rqtl","summary":"The Naive Approach was the classic k-means algorithm that proved to be the most effective. We created a matrix where each user corresponds to a row and each movie or TV series is represented by a column. The matrix elements were binary, taking the value of 0 or 1 based on whether the user had viewed a particular title.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/eb2a59f92aa00f372318b4d2243bec54?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-08-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"4pSWV9uBF","title":"Testing All Endpoints in Django: An Overview","url":"https://showmax.engineering/articles/testing-all-endpoints-in-django-an-overview","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/testing-all-endpoints-in-django-an-overview-4pswv9ubf","summary":"Testing All Endpoints in Django: An Overview Testing is a crucial aspect of software development. Even a single broken link or endpoint can result in a poor user experience or security vulnerabilities. Django offers powerful testing tools, including the Django test framework, which can be enhanced with third-party packages like pytest.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3b240b26679e3808588e4b7b8f795476?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-07-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"TRmoTYEDi","title":"\u201cSpotted a Bug on Your Smart TV? Send It to Us!\u201d Says Tom\u00e1\u0161 Zeman, Team Leader of the Showmax Smart TV and Web Team","url":"https://showmax.engineering/articles/spotted-a-bug-on-your-smart-tv-send-it-to-us-says","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/spotted-a-bug-on-your-smart-tv-send-it-to-us-says-tom-zeman-team-leader-of-the-showmax-smart--trmotyedi","summary":"Showmax has around 25 or 30 TVs there currently and that\u2019s the maximum we\u2019ve had so far. We also have more models, which our customers don\u2019t use that much, in storage. The world of TVs is different from what we know on mobile phones or computers.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3297f11be9ee1b7ebb963713aa154d1a?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-06-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"awtX3PU9y","title":"VMAF - Performance vs. Accuracy","url":"https://showmax.engineering/articles/vmaf---performance-vs.-accuracy","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/vmaf---performance-vs-accuracy-awtx3pu9y","summary":"VMAF, short for Video Multimethod Assessment Fusion, was developed by Netflix in 2016. It can be highly resource intensive, especially when it needs to be calculated multiple times per profile within a per-title encoding pipeline. The cost of quality assessment can potentially exceed the cost of the actual encoding process itself.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/5e77016e084987e2137e2fcb106f78b8?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-06-16T00:00:00.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["artsy","developerdao","ntietz","Marmelab","appsflyer"],"opposite_handles":["dailydevworld","on_leuwcq","horde","watercooler","dotnetsquad"],"similar":[{"id":"artsy","handle":"artsy","name":"Artsy.net","is_squad":false,"x":1.8346,"y":-0.2563,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":12,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/d72060ae77ca4103b2c34329b400a673","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":0.11316,"median_upvotes":0.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"hype_score":0.0,"avg_read_time":6.166667,"tag_diversity":2.166667},"top_tags_preview":[["react-native",2],["react",2],["webdev",2]],"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[-4.75,9.4559],"cadence_depth":[-9.5441,0.6324],"hype_variety":[-9.3824,0.0588],"title_style":[8.1765,-9.1471]}},